1. DEFINITIONS
==============================================================================

"Software" refers to the AdeshLang programming language, its compiler,
runtime, standard library, language server, tooling, associated documentation
files, and all source code contained in this repository.

"Licensor" refers to the copyright holder, AdeshLang (Ajay Tainwala).

"Contributor" refers to any individual or entity that submits original work
to the Software for inclusion or modification by the Licensor.

"Contribution" refers to any original work of authorship, including
modifications, additions, or corrections, intentionally submitted by a
Contributor to the Licensor for inclusion in the Software.

"Derivative Work" refers to any work that is based on or derived from the
Software, including translations, modifications, compilations, or any other
form in which the Software may be recast, transformed, or adapted.

"Recipient" refers to any person or entity who receives or uses the Software
under the terms of this License.

"Standard Library" refers to the built-in library modules shipped with
AdeshLang, including but not limited to Crypto, TLS, HTTP, WebSocket, IO,
Path, Process, Env, Time, Compression, Encoding, Random, URL, and System.

